📌 Objective

The objective of this project is to design and develop a responsive and visually appealing landing page for PurpleGlow Skincare, a fictional skincare brand. The website aims to present the brand’s identity, showcase skincare essentials, and enhance user engagement with an elegant layout and smooth navigation.

🧩 Steps Performed
1.Project Setup
Created an HTML file (index.html) to structure the website.
Linked an external CSS file (style.css) for layout and design styling.

2.Page Structure
Header & Navigation Bar – Includes brand logo “PurpleGlow” and menu links (Home, Products, Testimonials, Contact).
Hero Section – Highlights the brand tagline “Glow Naturally with PurpleGlow” and includes a call-to-action button.
Products Section – Displays five main skincare products:
Cleanser
Toner
Serum
Moisturizer
Sunscreen
Each product image is clickable and opens a modal displaying five brand options.
Testimonials Section – Includes positive customer feedback with quotes.
Footer – Provides contact information and copyright details.
3.Modal Functionality
Implemented interactive modals that appear when a product is clicked, showcasing additional details dynamically using JavaScript.
4.Responsive Design
Used flexible layouts and media queries to ensure compatibility across different devices (desktop, tablet, mobile).

🛠️ Tools & Technologies Used

HTML5 – Structure and content organization.
CSS3 – Styling, layout, and responsiveness.
JavaScript (Vanilla JS) – Modal interactivity and dynamic content loading.
Google Fonts (Quicksand) – For elegant typography.
Visual Studio Code – Development environment.

🎯 Outcome

A modern, responsive, and interactive landing page that enhances brand visibility and user engagement.
Users can explore the skincare product range, read testimonials, and contact the brand easily.
The site maintains a consistent color scheme and smooth navigation for a professional skincare brand look.
